  "description": "Attribute Explorer is an XrmToolbox Plugin that will help you analyze your attribute metadata properties. The primary grid provides functionality to show or hide any and all entity metadata. Additionally, you can group, filter, sort and export this information to Excel, the way you want. Helpful when creating data dictionaries or integration mapping documentation. This documentation will help you use this tool and all of its features.",
